Note on bundled binaries
------------------------

This repository redistributes a small number of binaries under `tools/` so
that the converter works offline with no external dependencies:

    testf1a_dec.exe    JieLi F1A decoder, extracted from the vendor tool
                       package "音频文件转换工具_1.2.2.exe"
    msvcr100.dll       Microsoft Visual C++ runtime required by the above
    ump3_ffmpeg.exe    FFmpeg build (N-76648-g6f520ce, 2015), GPL/LGPL

These files are the property of their respective copyright holders and are
NOT covered by the MIT license above. They are included solely so that users
can decode their own audio files. FFmpeg is distributed under the terms of
the LGPL/GPL; see https://ffmpeg.org/legal.html
